<apex:page renderAs="pdf"
            showHeader="false"
            sidebar="false"
            applyBodyTag="false"
            applyHtmlTag="false"
            controller="BP_ClientSummaryPdfController"
            standardStylesheets="false"
            readOnly="true"
           >

<html>
     <head>
        <style>
            @page {
                size: A4;
                margin: 20px 20px 20px 60px;
            }
        </style>
        
    </head>
            
<body style="font-family:Times,serif;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.1;">
<div style="text-align:center;font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:20px;">
    State Pension <u>LETTER OF AUTHORITY</u> to Dept of Work &amp; Pensions (DWP)
</div>

<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;">

    <tr>
        <td colspan="2"
            style="padding:6px;font-weight:bold;">
            <u>Client Details</u>
        </td>

        <td colspan="2"
            style="padding:6px;font-weight:bold;">
            <u>Representative Details</u>
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;width:18%;">
            Nat Ins No:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;width:32%;">
            {!ninoString}
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;width:18%;">
            Company Name:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;width:32%;">
            XtraPension Ltd
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;">
            Full Name:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            {!client.First_Name__c} {!client.Last_Name__c}
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;">
            Irish Co Number:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            749802
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;">
            Date of Birth:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            <apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}">
                <apex:param value="{!client.Claimant_dob__c}"/>
            </apex:outputText>
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;">
            Email:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            claims@xtrapension.com
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;">
            Email:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            {!client.Email__c}
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;">
            Tel:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            +353 91 335 583
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;">
            Tel:
            <br/>
            <br/>
            Address:
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;vertical-align:top;">
            {!client.Phone__c}
            <br/>
            <br/>
            <apex:repeat value="{!addressLines}" var="line">
                <span>{!line} </span> <br/>
            </apex:repeat>
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;">
            Address:
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;">
            Gray Office Park<br/>
            Headford Rd<br/>
            Galway, H91 WC1P<br/>
            Ireland
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td style="padding:5px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;">

        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;">
            
        </td>

        <td style="padding:5px;">
        </td>
        <td style="padding:5px;">
            
        </td>
    </tr>

</table>

<div style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:bold;">
    <u>1. Authorisation &amp; Scope</u>
</div>

<div style="margin-top:8px;">
    I authorise <b>XtraPension Ltd</b> and its staff to act as my representative regarding my State Pension entitlements.
</div>

<div style="margin-top:8px;">
    I explicitly authorise the <b>Department for Work and Pensions (DWP)</b> to discuss my records and share full copies of my personal data, pension forecasts, and all calculations / DWP decisions regarding them.
</div>

<div style="margin-top:8px;">
    This authority covers:
</div>

<div style="margin-left:18px;margin-top:5px;">
    • State Pension claims, forecasts, deferred lump sums, official errors and underlying workings.<br/>
    • SERPS, S2P, Graduated Retirement Benefit, and Additional Pension components relating to me and/or my spouse where applicable.<br/>
    • National Insurance records (including contribution gaps, HRP, and credits).<br/>
    • Enquiries, disputes, mandatory reconsiderations, and appeals (SSCS1).
</div>

<div style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:bold;">
    <u>2. Exclusions</u>
</div>

<div style="margin-top:8px;">
    This authority is strictly limited to information sharing, calculations, and representation.<br/>
    <b>It does not authorise XtraPension Ltd to:</b>
</div>

<div style="margin-left:18px;margin-top:5px;">
    • Receive any payments, arrears, lump sums, or benefits on my behalf.<br/>
    • Change my bank details held by the DWP.<br/>
    • Act as my appointee, attorney, or deputy.
</div>

<div style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:bold;">
    <u>3. Duration &amp; Revocation</u>
</div>

<div style="margin-top:8px;">
    This authority remains valid until my state pension claim and/or all related matters are fully resolved.
</div>

<div style="margin-top:5px;">
    I reserve the right to revoke this authority at any time in writing or by phone.
</div>

<div style="margin-top:80px; position:relative;">
    Client Signature:
    <span style="position:absolute; left:180px; top:0; color:white;">
        \s1\
    </span>
    _____________________
</div>

<div style="margin-top:30px; position:relative;">
    Date:
    <span style="position:absolute; left: 100px; top:0; color:white;">
        \d1\
    </span>
    _____________________
</div>

</body>
</html>

</apex:page>